{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Bazaar kill tokens at maximum level need a mob within three levels",
  "contract": "At default settings a level-60 character earns tokens only from creatures at most three levels below them, while a level-59 character is held only to the grey rule. In one Blackrock Depths group, Warder Stilgiss 9041 (level 56, spawn guid 47774) pays the level-60 member nothing and the level-59 member 6-12; Panzor the Invincible 8923 (level 57, spawn guid 300627) pays both members 6-12.",
